00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
In an updated contemporary version of the beloved stage play and 1989 film, "Steel
Magnolias" chronicles the lives and friendship of six women in Louisiana.

3
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Supporting each other through their triumphs and tragedies, they congregate at Truvy’s beauty shop to ponder the mysteries of life
and death, husbands and children - and hair and nails - all the important topics that truly unite and celebrate women.

